00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.220
FDA already approved it though, right?

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.920
The Food and Drug Administration, or FDA,

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:56.600
already cleared it for another indication, which shortens the path.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.680
Doctors can prescribe it off label while the hypertension specific data catch up.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:06.640
Operator brain, the failure mode is screening. If you never test for the hormonal subtype,

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.280
the clever drug never gets offered.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:12.560
